  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reforming policy coordination in the Government represents the phase of the process during which a new policy making and coordination model will be developed and piloted and the roles of players in the policy making redesigned. A unified planning model will be created to ensure that policies are strategic, designed around outcomes and properly costed.</narrative>
